@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
state "待检" as Pending
state "可用" as Available
state "隔离" as Isolated
state "停用" as Disabled
state "过期" as Expired
[*] --> Pending : 形成批次来源\n[已知材料和到货来源]\n/ 保留效期与批号
Pending --> Available : 确认合格范围\n[验收已认可且未过期]\n/ 允许合格量计可用
Available --> Isolated : 立即隔离批次\n[发现异常]\n/ 立即禁止正常领用
Isolated --> Disabled : 审核恢复或停用\n[负责人决定停用]\n/ 保留原因
Isolated --> Available : 审核恢复或停用\n[依据充分且未过期]\n/ 保留恢复确认
Disabled --> Available : 审核恢复或停用\n[异常解决且未过期]\n/ 保留恢复依据
Available --> Expired : 判断效期\n[已过有效期]\n/ 停止正常领用
Isolated --> Expired : 判断效期\n[已过有效期]\n/ 保持不可用
Pending --> Expired : 判断效期\n[已过有效期]\n/ 不得转可用

@enduml
